## Claim under pressure

DNS/UDP capability honesty under CAP-G1 (granular net) + CAP-G6 (std facades):

| Slice | Path-A expectation |
|-------|--------------------|
| DNS product residual | `resolve_ipv4` prefers **UdpCap** (UDP query path); **not** HttpCap; **not** hard NetCap-only |
| Verify / tests | **Never** construct `Cap(0)` / `NetCap(0)` / `UdpCap(0)` (forge theater banned — PROBE B3) |
| Ambient DNS | OS `getaddrinfo` only after parent sealed require (tcp/fetch/tls); no free ambient resolve API |
| HttpCap as DNS | HttpCap must **not** authorize UDP bind/recv/raw; DNS facade must not take HttpCap |
| Residual honesty | Localhost hardcode + Err string ≠ product DNS; no greenwash "real resolver" |

Adversarial stance: treat any `Cap(0)` in verify as **CRIT forge theater** until removed.
Treat DE1 partial (rename NetCap→UdpCap while keeping NetCap(0) verify + rationalizing comment)
as **failed CRIT fix**. Treat ambient `getaddrinfo` under Tcp/Http require as **MED residual**
(parent sealed, DNS not separately UdpCap-sealed) — not fail-open of the parent op.

