| Push | **None** (mandate) |

**Not changed (residual, not CRIT forge theater):**

- Ambient `getaddrinfo` under TcpCap/HttpCap sealed parents (H2 MED).
- User-fn arg cap types not enforced (HttpCap→UdpCap param still check OK) (H3 MED).
- `resolve_ipv4` not in `sealed_net_kind_of` (not a free sealed name; no check enforce until product UDP DNS).
- Emit messages still say `&NetCap` for many net ops (CAP-G1 honesty residual).
- No product DnsCap type invented.

